<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for New York City GO bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for New York City GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Wednesday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for New York City general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity is limited and now available on a first-come first-served basis. For more information please call 1-800-MBIA-NOW.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
